      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "I’ll attack with both Mesa Unicorn and Trusty Retriever. Emiel the Blessed is still summoning sick, so it can’t attack this turn. Mesa Unicorn (3/3) and Trusty Retriever (3/4) present a combined 6 power. My opponent has Eidolon of Rhetoric and Amoeboid Changeling, but they’re tapped, and they may not want to block into my 3/4 with lifelink potential (if it gets a counter). \n\
