- Affa Guard Hound {2}{W}\n\
- Inspiring Unicorn {2}{W}{W}\n\
- Release the Dogs {3}{W}\n\
- Secure the Scene {4}{W}\n\
- Selfless Savior {W}\n\
\n\
I can cast any of these.\n\
\n\
Best play: cast Inspiring Unicorn. For {2}{W}{W}, I get a 2/2 that, when it attacks, makes all my creatures +1/+1 until end of turn. That turns:\n\
- Mesa Unicorn into 5/4 (lifelink)\n\
- Trusty Retriever into 5/5\n\
- Cathar’s Companion into 5/3 (lifelink)\n\
- Inspiring Unicorn into 3/3\n\
\n\
