\n\
Or Secure the Scene to remove a permanent — but not necessary.\n\
\n\
Or Affa Guard Hound flash on a creature — but tempo loss.\n\
\n\
Best to go wide and buff.\n\
\n\
Cast Inspiring Unicorn.\n\
\n\
Tap two Plains and one Thriving Heath for {2}{W}{W}.\n\
\n\
Cast it.\n\
