\n\
I cannot counter it — I have no cards.\n\
\n\
I could sacrifice selfless Savior to give indestructible to Trusty Retriever, but I don't have it in play.\n\
\n\
I did not cast it.\n\
\n\
So I take the removal.\n\
\n\
Trusty Retriever will die.\n\
\n\
But my other creatures are still attacking.\n\
\n\
Mesa Unicorn and Cathar’s Companion will deal 3+4 = 7 damage, unblocked likely.\n\
\n\
Plus, I have Inspiring Unicorn in play — its ability triggers when it attacks, but it didn't attack.\n\
\n\
So no trigger.\n\
\n\
Damage will be 3 (Mesa Unicorn) + 4 (Cathar’s Companion) = 7, since Trusty is removed.\n\
\n\
They are at 8 — 7 damage drops them to 1.\n\
\n\
Not lethal.\n\
\n\
But I have more in hand.\n\
\n\
I let Divine Verdict resolve. No response.\n\
\n\
Pass priority.\n\
