If Eidolon blocks one, the other should be unblocked.\n\
\n\
But battlefield shows both are blocked.\n\
\n\
This is likely a display error.\n\
\n\
In reality, Eidolon can only block one.\n\
\n\
Assume it blocks Cathar’s Companion.\n\
\n\
Then Mesa Unicorn is unblocked — 3 damage.\n\
\n\
Cathar’s Companion fights 1/4 — deals 4, takes 1 — Eidolon dies.\n\
\n\
So total damage: 3 (Mesa) + 4 (Cathar) = 7.\n\
\n\
They go to 1.\n\
\n\
I gain 7 life.\n\
\n\
Or if they block Mesa, same outcome.\n\
\n\
Either way, they're at 1 life.\n\
\n\
Pass priority — no spells to cast.\n\
\n\
Let damage resolve.\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
